<title>POLAND: Elektrim plunges after net revision.</title>
<headline>Elektrim plunges after net revision.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish industrial and trading conglomerate Elektrim SA plunged 9.8 percent to 23.9 zlotys after Wednesday's news that the firm had revised down its 1996 net profit to 40.3 million zlotys from 49.8 million, traders said.</p>
<p>Turnover was a session-high 13.6 million zlotys but traders said the stock's balanced trade after price-fixing and a good earnings outlook augured a possible rebound on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
